installations such as boardrooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, this commercial-grade smart TV is specifically designed for boardrooms and luxury residences, providing reliable performance with a sleek design and smart features powered by Android TV.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level of this TV, and how does it perform in brightly lit rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 500 nits, the display remains clear and visible even in well-lit environments, making it perfect for corporate offices and luxury villas with natural lighting.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does this TV support popular smart TV applications and streaming services?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, powered by Android TV, it supports a wide range of popular applications and streaming platforms, ensuring seamless access to content and productivity tools.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Commercial Smart TV 85\\\" 4K comes with a standard manufacturer\\u2019s warranty and dedicated customer support to ensure long-term reliability and assistance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this TV compare to LED video walls or other display solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While LED video walls offer scalability and ultra-high brightness, this 85\\\" 4K smart TV provides an all-in-one, cost-effective solution with 4K clarity and smart features, ideal for medium to large spaces requiring premium image quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this TV be wall-mounted or integrated into custom installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports standard wall-mounting options, allowing flexible installation in boa