g experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs this smart TV suitable for professional installations such as boardrooms?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, this commercial-grade smart TV is specifically designed for boardrooms and luxury residences, providing reliable performance with a sleek design and smart features powered by Android TV.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the brightness level of this TV, and how does it perform in brightly lit rooms?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith a brightness of 500 nits, the display remains clear and visible even in well-lit environments, making it perfect for corporate offices and luxury villas with natural lighting.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDoes this TV support popular smart TV applications and streaming services?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, powered by Android TV, it supports a wide range of popular applications and streaming platforms, ensuring seamless access to content and productivity tools.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Commercial Smart TV 85\\\\\\\" 4K UHD | Brightluxx Dubai\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Shop the 85\\\\\\\" Commercial Smart TV 4K UHD for ultimate visual experience. Available in Dubai, UAE. Order your premium display now!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/commercial-smart-tv-85\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n