ion quality of the Commercial Smart TV 85&quot; 4K?</h3><p>The TV offers a stunning 4K UHD resolution, delivering crystal-clear images and vibrant colors, ideal for detailed presentations and immersive viewing experiences.</p><h3>Is this smart TV suitable for professional installations such as boardrooms?</h3><p>Yes, this commercial-grade smart TV is specifically designed for boardrooms and luxury residences, providing reliable performance with a sleek design and smart features powered by Android TV.</p><h3>What is the brightness level of this TV, and how does it perform in brightly lit rooms?</h3><p>With a brightness of 500 nits, the display remains clear and visible even in well-lit environments, making it perfect for corporate offices and luxury villas with natural lighting.</p><h3>Does this TV support popular smart TV applications and streaming services?</h3><p>Yes, powered by Android TV, it supports a wide range of popular applications and streaming platforms, ensuring seamless access to content and productivity tools.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Commercial Smart TV 85\\\" 4K UHD | Brightluxx Dubai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Shop the 85\\\" Commercial Smart TV 4K UHD for ultimate visual experience. Available in Dubai, UAE. Order your premium display now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/commercial-smart-tv-85\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/commercial-smart-tv-85\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints